    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code shows an example of applying three polynomials to a [`vImage.InterleavedFx4`](vimage/interleavedfx4.md) buffer:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code shows an example of applying three polynomials to a [`vImage.InterleavedFx4`](vimage/interleavedfx4.md) buffer:",
      "sourceHash": "aac651b87f8cc7e72df08053713c3b1a4bc19d31ab9c87e515b480dd9af16dbe",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet src = vImage.PixelBuffer<vImage.InterleavedFx4>(\n    pixelValues: [0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0],\n    size: vImage.Size(width: 1, height: 1))\n\nlet dest = vImage.PixelBuffer<vImage.Interleaved8x4>(\n    size: src.size)\n\nlet factor = Float(255)\nsrc.applyPolynomial(coefficientSegments: [ [1 * factor, 0, 0],\n                                           [0, 1 * factor, 0],\n                                           [0, 0, 1 * factor] ],\n                    boundaries: [0, 1/3, 2/3, 1] as [Float],\n                    destination: dest)\n\n// Prints:\n//  255     ≅ factor * 0.25⁰\n\n//  127     ≅ factor * 0.5¹\n\n//  143     ≅ factor * 0.75²\n//  255     ≅ factor * 1.0²\nprint(dest.array)\n```",
      "documentTitle": "applyPolynomial(coefficientSegments:boundaries:destination:)",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
